## Install or upgrade

1. Extract the entire ZIP.
2. Close Skate and every ReSkate launcher window.
3. Run `Install.cmd`. If Windows denies access to the Steam folder, run it as administrator.
4. Start ReSkate normally, enter a solo map, and press **Home**.

The installer validates the supported game and package hashes, and backs up your DLL/launcher under `EarlyTrainerBackups`.
Default folder: `C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Skate`.
This is a custom ReSkate DLL and matching launcher, not a Mods-tab package. `Restore.ps1` restores a selected backup. `Install.ps1 -VerifyOnly` checks compatibility without installing.
